Couleur Plugin for DokuWiki

Creates images of european fraternity colors, usually presented as flags or
worn as ribbons across the chest.

USAGE

<band:PERCUSSION COLOR1 COLOR2 ... COLORN>

PERCUSSION is an optional argument for creating a stitching at the top and
bottom of a ribbon.

At least two colors (as HTML names or hex-encoded) are added as arguments.

E.g. <band:silver white #6B841A black white> creates the colors of
AV Frisia Hannover.

